{strides: tensor, data_format: str} |= if data_format = "NCHW" then shape(strides, 0) = 1 else if data_format = "NHWC" then shape(strides, 3) = 1
>>
Rule 128 (If NHWC, the spatial dimensions must be positive, and also less than the input size (if VALID padding).)
{input: tensor, ksize: tensor, strides: tensor, data_format: str, padding: str} |= if data_format = "NHWC" ∧ padding = "VALID" then shape(strides, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(strides, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(ksize, 1) <= shape(input, 1) ∧ shape(ksize, 2) <= shape(input, 2)
>>
Rule 129 (Ksize has to be positive (Dimensions 1 and 2).)
{ksize : tensor} |= shape(ksize, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(ksize, 2) > 0
>>
Rule 130 (Strides has to be positive (Dimensions 1 and 2).)
{strides : tensor} |= shape(strides, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(strides, 2) > 0
>>
Rule 131 (If using the VALID padding the output dimensions must be greater than 0)
{input: tensor, ksize: tensor, strides: tensor, padding: str} |= if padding = "VALID" then ((shape(input, 1) - shape(ksize, 1) + shape(strides, 1)) / shape(strides, 1)) > 0 ∧ ((shape(input, 2) - shape(ksize, 2) + shape(strides, 2)) / shape(strides, 2)) > 0
>>
Rule 132 (If data_format is NHWC input's dimensions should be in order of [batch, height, width, channel])
{input: tensor, data_format: str} |= if data_format = "NHWC" then ndim(input) = 4
>>
Rule 133 (Strides should be less or equal to the input dimensions.)
{input: tensor, strides: tensor} |= shape(strides, 1) ≤ shape(input, 1) ∧ shape(strides, 2) ≤ shape(input, 2)
